#
# CRM & Documents:
# - Notion: $0 (free personal plan)
#
# Notifications:
# - Slack: $0 (free tier)
#
# Booking:
# - Calendly: $0 (free tier - unlimited bookings)
#
# Payments:
# - Stripe: 2.9% + $0.30 per transaction (no monthly fee)
#
# TOTAL: ~$26-31/month (excluding Stripe transaction fees)
# vs Traditional SaaS Stack: ~$371/month
# SAVINGS: $345/month = $4,140/year! 💰
