# ========================================
# 📝 NOTION DATABASE SETUP GUIDE
# ========================================
#
# NOTION_CRM_DATABASE_ID Setup:
# 1. Create a Notion database with these properties:
#    - Name (Title)
#    - Email (Email)
#    - Source (Select: Quote Form, Contact Form, Calendly, Testimonial, Referral)
#    - Service (Select: Web & Brand, AI Development, Health-Tech, Ghostwriting, Consulting)
#    - Status (Status: 🆕 New, 📞 Contacted, 💰 Quoted, 🎉 Won, ❌ Lost, 💤 Nurturing)
#    - Budget (Text)
#    - Quote Amount (Text)
#    - Created (Date)
#    - Last Contact (Date)
#    - Priority (Select: 🔥 Hot, ⚡ Warm, ❄️ Cold)
#    - Notes (Long Text)
#
# 2. Share database with your Notion integration:
#    - Open database → "..." menu → Add connections → Select your integration
#
# 3. Get database ID from URL:
#    https://notion.so/YOUR_WORKSPACE/DATABASE_ID?v=...
#                                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
#
# NOTION_SOW_DATABASE_ID Setup:
# 1. Create a Notion database with these properties:
#    - Name (Title) - Auto-filled as "SOW – Client – Project"
#    - Client (Text)
#    - Project (Text)
#    - Service Category (Select: Web & Brand, AI Development, Health-Tech, Ghostwriting, Consulting, Other)
#    - Start Date (Date)
#    - End Date (Date)
#    - Total Fee (Number)
#
# 2. Share database with your Notion integration (same as above)
# 3. Get database ID from URL (same as above)
#
# ========================================
